<body>
    <h1>Delphi AI Chatbot</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"9a45baf57d1e" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-DelphiGPT-AICha=
tbotPlatform:End-to-EndArchitecture&amp;Flow">DelphiGPT - AI Chatbot Platfo=
rm: End-to-End Architecture &amp; Flow</h1>
<blockquote local-id=3D"cdcce0411280">
<p local-id=3D"a1cbdddcea8f"><strong>Document Intelligence (RAG) + Structur=
ed Data Q&amp;A, orchestrated by a LangGraph multi-tool agent</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"dba30b521993">
<h2 local-id=3D"97b9d120ad0f" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-1.ExecutiveSummary">1. =
Executive Summary</h2>
<p local-id=3D"75b4aed91913">DelphiGPT is a conversational AI platform that=
 lets a business user ask questions in plain English and get answers ground=
ed in <strong>two very different kinds of data</strong>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"047b27edf56d">
<li local-id=3D"4ea6370a8164">
<p local-id=3D"5fe3539159f9"><strong>Unstructured content the user brings t=
o the conversation</strong> - PDFs, PowerPoint decks, Word documents, sprea=
dsheets and images uploaded into a chat session.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dfaace1c6e1f">
<p local-id=3D"44c20ffb7a23"><strong>Structured enterprise data already hel=
d in the warehouse</strong> - product, sales, social media and review datas=
ets in Azure SQL.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"b19eea6ee46a">A single <strong>LangGraph agent</strong> sits=
 between the user and these sources. It reads the intent behind each questi=
on and dispatches it to one of eight purpose-built tools - vector retrieval=
, claims extraction and scoring, NL2SQL, in-memory spreadsheet analytics, o=
r image understanding. The user never chooses a mode; routing is inferred.<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"e94c032c9959">Three design positions define the platform and=
 are the thread running through this page:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1f=
49747318d8" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"70f208762974">
<th data-local-id=3D"1c0bff9b7aec" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8a673a19a745">#</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"7fa7480b9489" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f8d0107409a6">Position</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"856f0ea5d814" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9188d5deac04">Why it matters</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"aadafe466e2e">
<td data-local-id=3D"3fefc5397dad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a81ec4d397b">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e4c33863d6e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2acc57b4c3d5"><strong>One agent, many tools</strong> - not o=
ne pipeline per data type</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dee968d2fabc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ec953092e8a">Users ask mixed questions. A single orchestrat=
or keeps the UX to a single chat box while the complexity stays server-side=
.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"235501483e58">
<td data-local-id=3D"922615b8e18c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7e344868f964">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc6d1b50e837" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b1e5ab782a0"></p>
<p local-id=3D"dd267b59d92f"><strong>Similarity search is a </strong><em><s=
trong>signal</strong></em><strong>, not an </strong><em><strong>answer</str=
ong></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"76771669a69b">- for structured data</p>
<p local-id=3D"447b2ca9f700"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"90c925c8a3d2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"076709c0f8a9">Vector search is approximate by design. Busine=
ss questions such as "how many products=E2=80=A6" demand exact, complete re=
sults, so retrieval is used to narrow the search space and SQL delivers the=
 final, verifiable answer.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a4617bda3a6a">
<td data-local-id=3D"bbee74ddc385" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"059877cfadcc">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"561f3eb48989" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"523350f970d6"><strong>Everything is scoped to a </strong><co=
de>thread_id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"96e5405efdcf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f5b28637ef76">Session isolation is enforced at the storage a=
nd retrieval layer, not just in the UI, so no session can see another's upl=
oads or vectors.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<blockquote local-id=3D"693722fa271e">
<p local-id=3D"84b25bea1fed"><strong>Reading tip for reviewers:</strong> Se=
ctions 2=E2=80=935 describe <em>what the system is</em>. Sections 6=E2=80=
=939 describe <em>how data moves through it</em>. Section 10 is the enginee=
ring deep dive - the hardest problem on the platform and how it was solved.=
 Sections 11=E2=80=9314 cover isolation, trade-offs and open items.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"f6bed853afeb">
<h2 local-id=3D"a44b9ffb1b70" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-2.CapabilityOverview">2=
. Capability Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d5a1e89a4306">What a user can actually do, and what runs und=
erneath.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1f=
4a781eb3c4" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c6218491d807">
<th data-local-id=3D"feab5bcb414c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d1124dccaebf">User asks=E2=80=A6</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1072da3a799c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ff4844098d47">Example</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b9613114eaee" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"717bbc4fdd5f">Data source</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"911103759feb" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ee2960a114f0">Engine</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0caede779e65">
<td data-local-id=3D"bd79825bb188" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6facb543b23f">A question about a document they uploaded</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2ae5820f460f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e33630ac0df8"><em>"Summarise the risks in this contract"</em=
></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"59b6b53d20ca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79825842907c">ADLS Gen2 =E2=86=92 Azure AI Search</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f34202095cf0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55444d28d441">RAG over vector index</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4bcd43e9113a">
<td data-local-id=3D"f2aafe6cf9f1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e807970cfec1">For product claims from a document</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b079ba1283a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08f711dbe0a8"><em>"Extract and score the claims in this pack=
"</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"11c8ad4974f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2429bee403d8">Uploaded document</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7e631f43a42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12925674af9d">Claims tools + custom ML scoring model</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"94ffa1707d3d">
<td data-local-id=3D"5f76dd6f887f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f9e99f82378">A question about enterprise data</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6564b12851e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5f28fa910883"><em>"What were Q3 sales for Product X?"</em></=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f0a2a0c517fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c9d16f87161f">Azure SQL Database</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5642b32fe492" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b6b9c71a68f">NL2SQL with entity resolution</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2e4e1f3223db">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae838aab54b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"33f90f7c441b">A question about an uploaded spreadsheet</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ce1f503a8ac9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a5a047c56f47"><em>"Which region had the lowest margin?"</em>=
</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3457d4ec083c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24cb67247379">ADLS Gen2 (XLSX/CSV)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a813ae3d418b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"986c4202961d">DuckDB in-memory OLAP</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f70eb24c9f5c">
<td data-local-id=3D"c9337bf5b8d2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"17ee354b7cad">A question about an uploaded image</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5ff0fbda284c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efc972f95320"><em>"What does this chart show?"</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4d132ef34fb8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"65b6f21310a4">ADLS Gen2 + Azure AI Search</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4cbbb4780e45" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a14c4338e6b6">Gemini 2.5 Pro description =E2=86=92 embedded =
=E2=86=92 retrieved</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"78ab1b774909">
<h2 local-id=3D"5f7aa46de214" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-3.TechnologyStack">3. T=
echnology Stack</h2><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-c=
enter-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-emb=
edded-image image-center" alt=3D"01-technology-stack.png" width=3D"468" loa=
ding=3D"lazy" src=3D"222c33716f2cff3c462a3a85dae03c362b9659166ddc5401f6db50=
acc619401c" data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/=
wiki/download/attachments/1733361714/01-technology-stack.png?version=3D1&am=
p;modificationDate=3D1786536201257&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-=
height=3D"540" data-width=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-=
linked-resource-id=3D"1733492799" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-l=
inked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"01=
-technology-stack.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atla=
ssian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked=
-resource-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-versio=
n=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"7e49638f-304e-4a8c-9868-4c5ed8a86d60" data-media-t=
ype=3D"file" height=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"2013f5d85d60"><em>Figure 1 - Core components across frontend=
, backend, AI, storage and data layers.</em></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2f=
7ead2a8531" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9420830206a8">
<th data-local-id=3D"b4199d461573" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e7c8aac3b747">Layer</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d9d0129c1a0c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a63667d9060d">Component</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"76eb0d913809" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7e3c647555cf">Responsibility</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4f6743862b18">
<td data-local-id=3D"032f21419376" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"186ddbe6ab99"><strong>Frontend</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3dedca6cd477" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d1adae082866">Next.js</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"62e70a9813d6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"316bb45ff08e">Chat UI, document upload and in-browser previe=
w, response rendering, session management.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d80513261d28">
<td data-local-id=3D"f4a4db2e53ed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f84ccf698d2"><strong>Backend API</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eca60a0482b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6e0029c8dba7">FastAPI</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a43cf798d208" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"41d9735ddd3c">High-performance async API layer handling uplo=
ads, chat requests and tool-orchestration calls.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cab39a317efe">
<td data-local-id=3D"69f7e87ae205" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0ce5b45942b"><strong>LLM framework</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d99f806cf6f9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"740f3a64ceef">LangChain</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"12f3907051fe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43fecb17c192">Prompting, embeddings, retrievers and tool abs=
tractions.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a48347d7c102">
<td data-local-id=3D"7fceb8a6b30b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1915adda711c"><strong>Orchestration</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9e2678b62c33" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9397dd5da79c">LangGraph</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e68640f61d00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a8316b590aa6">Stateful multi-tool agent graph that dynamical=
ly routes each query to the right tool.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"03e83546dce5">
<td data-local-id=3D"bc52c36bee3b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce16a397ef55"><strong>Object storage</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"edfee7833ee4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"83cba6f2337c">ADLS Gen2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d842f084b3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efba2fd49911">Durable, per-session storage for raw uploaded =
documents, images and spreadsheets.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"082650c5cebc">
<td data-local-id=3D"29b031acf923" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c94f1fa6f535"><strong>Vector store</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00857aa022d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ba419537563">Azure AI Search</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81a76632c77b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43149889736d">Index of document and image chunks; powers ret=
rieval-augmented generation and entity resolution.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6b7104f03468">
<td data-local-id=3D"58e63153a720" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"635644f45106"><strong>Relational store</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"100daa452dad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"926f4ad52410">Azure SQL Database</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eab2d9183fa3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a86b09e8fe1b">Product, sales, social media and review data; =
queried via NL2SQL.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a08c9d38990d">
<td data-local-id=3D"357c19757c63" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf9bae766539"><strong>Analytics engine</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6e1d6d88743d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"306096c5e5c3">DuckDB (in-memory OLAP)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1aaab16c0f68" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1dda836922b9">Direct SQL analytics over uploaded Excel/CSV f=
iles sitting in blob storage.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"13aec0dcdf94">
<td data-local-id=3D"6e8f6bb6765f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"97bb62125fb0"><strong>Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8c66e9a49448" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a77abb7e7f0">GPT-4 family =C2=B7 Gemini 2.5 Pro =C2=B7 <cod=
e>text-embedding-3-large</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"12540598c57c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"93ce06b432a5">Reasoning and agent orchestration =C2=B7 image=
 understanding =C2=B7 embeddings.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<blockquote local-id=3D"ff7a325e59d9">
<p local-id=3D"111fbc550943"><strong>Why two model families?</strong> GPT h=
andles reasoning, tool selection and SQL generation. Gemini 2.5 Pro is used=
 specifically for its multimodal strength - converting charts, scanned page=
s, photos and diagrams into rich descriptive text. Using the best model per=
 job costs nothing architecturally because both sit behind the same LangCha=
in abstraction.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"5d219fdc007e">
