<h3 local-id=3D"7cc0193d9090" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-4.2Layerresponsibilitie=
s">4.2 Layer responsibilities</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"51=
9161ac0dc4" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"85cf8fcd7730">
<th data-local-id=3D"fa4b95429356" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7c26b6e28167">Layer</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"68e790a5c433" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"dbd8f71a8cf5">Owns</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b8502223989f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3927ee0af42a">Explicitly does <strong>not</strong> own</p></=
th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c808d0e0d006">
<td data-local-id=3D"03a3cfa453fc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b048d942056b">Next.js frontend</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd2fb8cbbdf0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7da4da01260f">Conversation state in the browser, upload UX, =
preview via SAS URL, streamed rendering</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7d31f7648de7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e1c6d582c0c0">Any decision about which tool answers a questi=
on</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"682ad220eaa0">
<td data-local-id=3D"b5b84e9c2fdc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e96ff15b27bb">FastAPI backend</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e912c2137fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a3c9cdd9798">Auth-bound session (<code>thread_id</code>), f=
ile persistence, request/response contract</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c03908174af8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ec8a9c980b5">Prompt content or retrieval logic</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2acd75e0e75d">
<td data-local-id=3D"a20bc0119806" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37283754998e">LangChain layer</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8a2cbaba441a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"837e3793e46d">Prompt templates, embedding calls, retriever a=
nd tool wrappers</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b79165a61f2b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc45b9500d80">Intent decisions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d7f0e4b7e03a">
<td data-local-id=3D"f45187840fc2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1be1a3fd6a81">LangGraph agent</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72a47ec66d0f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90f93faba8f9">Intent interpretation, tool selection, multi-s=
tep state, final answer assembly</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ac8843a2f61" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d463721d683">Direct data access - always via a tool</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"58846e8a36ee">
<td data-local-id=3D"de7d1fb8b1c9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ca5c4415e548">Data &amp; AI services</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ab32e18c4d99" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82b7c300bab9">Storage, indexing, query execution, inference<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa7c99efa0ed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6752c03c6e43">Business logic</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<blockquote local-id=3D"d7286424507e">
<p local-id=3D"d87315cd85ad"><strong>Key architectural property:</strong> t=
he agent is the <em>only</em> component that decides anything. Every other =
layer is deterministic. That makes behaviour easy to trace - a wrong answer=
 is either a routing problem (agent) or a data problem (tool), never both.<=
/p>
</blockquote>
