<h3 local-id=3D"6d6f84a5fdb5" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-5.1Theeightboundtools">=
5.1 The eight bound tools</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"cf=
9c74297902" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f754d248ee39">
<th data-local-id=3D"a06ef08ef8cb" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a62857f8bd81">Group</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"55b5cdd979a5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3989af8b1d45">Tool</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"181e4929468b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9a3b9a23043e">What it does</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"666f4e32516d">
<td data-local-id=3D"60de3253c6a7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c2c95b8e934"><strong>Document Q&amp;A</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"10dc1c118262" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4f64dfbc319b"><code>retrieve_all_context_tool</code></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"2a25b18b9350" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b0b24eb71443">Broad retrieval across all indexed content for=
 the session - used for summarisation and open questions.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6b6c382c0200">
<td data-local-id=3D"2336379a6726" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8838bf1861aa"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d026185a1b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9df6b66013c3"><code>search_specific_information_tool</code><=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4aff4d13e21b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e630a8688444">Targeted retrieval when the question names a s=
pecific fact, section or term.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f0d3911d69e5">
<td data-local-id=3D"9a8a79ef1a76" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"744293a1c21f"><strong>Claims (CPG)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9a2d16f0255d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10a48d39acc5"><code>extract_claims_from_document</code></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b13da4eebe0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6971331bb048">Pulls product claims out of an uploaded docume=
nt.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1f1388746415">
<td data-local-id=3D"d45804e7a174" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f28c267478ea"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5fb9854fb4b3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eff2bc5d9807"><code>refine_extracted_claims</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bfadc8bc1a8f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4204dd99ef36">Cleans, deduplicates and normalises the extrac=
ted claim set.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"844d350e422d">
<td data-local-id=3D"217009c0f4b2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b03b46fc4cc"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f283b0fe2758" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"347172231c35"><code>score_extracted_claims</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"66c11b935a3c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da6edf7020a2">Scores each claim using a custom ML model.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"109660583254">
<td data-local-id=3D"4f2638fed308" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1173a855fb3"><strong>SQL Data</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1dc929b191cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efc428c9d5b2"><code>retrieve_data_from_sql</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"26ec481d7854" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c6bd91a0fb9">Answers questions on product, sales, social an=
d review data via NL2SQL.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6938b557acc8">
<td data-local-id=3D"621bfa43842e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ca682207845"><strong>Spreadsheets</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"26fecf73d955" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cac3bdcdb7ca"><code>analyze_uploaded_spreadsheets_tool</code=
></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"85975072d4e5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4624d5e9dc87">Answers questions on uploaded Excel/CSV using =
DuckDB.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b77328a708df">
<td data-local-id=3D"1657d8bb23a8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74e6ba72f0d8"><strong>Images</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5affada48b25" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27ddd95202bf"><code>analyze_image_tool</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"06f20f5f40e5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bdf66796dc7c">Answers questions about uploaded images using =
their indexed Gemini descriptions.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"ac9c3ec2e4e0" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-5.2Howroutingisdecided"=
>5.2 How routing is decided</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4222485e1594"></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wr=
apper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"c=
onfluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20260812-123116.png" wi=
dth=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"d3b6f80143928ea3678c2cd7ff3d61c4d09dea4=
cd710349327efedcc971c2b61" data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement=
.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1733361714/image-20260812-123116.p=
ng?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1786537878815&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&am=
p;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"1764" data-width=3D"4498" data-unresolved-commen=
t-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1733132382" data-linked-resource-v=
ersion=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-=
default-alias=3D"image-20260812-123116.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-kno=
wledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"6403d6ff-45f3-4489-bd3c-364b7=
e008bca" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"183"></span>
<p local-id=3D"0000eddfcb6c"></p>
<p local-id=3D"ec40f60775bc"></p>
<p local-id=3D"d32f4491eeb3">The agent is <strong>stateful</strong>: LangGr=
aph retains the conversation graph for the session, so follow-up questions =
("and for the previous quarter?") inherit the earlier resolved context rath=
er than starting cold. Multi-tool answers are possible - for example, extra=
cting claims from a document and then scoring them is a three-tool sequence=
 within a single user turn.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"a93200b2418e">
<h2 local-id=3D"e0593193dc8c" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-6.DocumentFlow-PDF,PPT&=
amp;DOCX(RAG)">6. Document Flow - PDF, PPT &amp; DOCX (RAG)</h2><span class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedd=
ed-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=
=3D"04-document-rag-flow.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"7b3ddd4=
373e93e49442f596803dc51494adee88db7b60d19437dd66133900805" data-image-src=
=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
1733361714/04-document-rag-flow.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1786=
536295677&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"540" data-width=
=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"173=
3132349" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"at=
tachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"04-document-rag-flow.png" d=
ata-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki" data-lin=
ked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=
=3D"0b5c7b8e-bd21-4e09-87d6-9f31e0dcdb3c" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"2a017e7ced3f"><em>Figure 4 - Ingestion pipeline (top) builds=
 the searchable index; query pipeline (bottom) answers questions using it.<=
/em></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"e4775a3aa1aa" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-6.1Ingestionpipeline">6=
.1 Ingestion pipeline</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"41=
3687edbd56" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d61629cc8eb">
<th data-local-id=3D"9b8f16728e3d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b91f1e668963">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9f6316d7b1ee" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"73836fd5583c">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ebea89f637a4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3e9f1b8a0151">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c3159baf8dcf">
<td data-local-id=3D"63d36eaf5fca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67b410c66201">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b1f7c534967e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"809fb8240b43"><strong>User uploads document</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"ae9cdf650e3d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35831fe0f4b7">PDF / PPT / DOCX submitted through the Next.js=
 UI.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ef5ace948201">
<td data-local-id=3D"e6c370690669" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"209ef0690bdd">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"93de04257e74" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8afbfc2a4db"><strong>Store in ADLS Gen2</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"515e682a68ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"78e9a06e211f">File saved to blob storage; a SAS URL is gener=
ated and returned so the user can preview the file in the UI.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8428657772b7">
<td data-local-id=3D"75f266f14c4b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9f885a3cbb78">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e8ca9a22583f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ffeca5198d8"><strong>Extract text</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2fbfca3fe8a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c571ec4b4de9">The <code>unstructured</code> library parses t=
he file and chunks all text content.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"570796391950">
<td data-local-id=3D"a2a02ff72af3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58cf051d1774">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"91af55a23c77" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d785988f68e0"><strong>Embed chunks</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d313ff631274" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a7902bd773bc">OpenAI <code>text-embedding-3-large</code> gen=
erates vector embeddings for each chunk.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"67d02cd602c5">
<td data-local-id=3D"59b2d5dc7c82" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bcdc5f33d15c">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"266ab204888b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db9e72b86b49"><strong>Index</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"94c6eae6ce77" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d29440cf1749">Embeddings plus source chunks are written to A=
zure AI Search, tagged with the session <code>thread_id</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"ff450069587d" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-6.2Querypipeline">6.2 Q=
uery pipeline</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e4=
aa1c30d485" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52b7d1fc42bc">
<th data-local-id=3D"7374a38de71f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"26be284e5615">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8f996c12ae36" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8f83684feb05">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6046f575d859" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"94f98ce0c6e7">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"188652dfd553">
<td data-local-id=3D"942a02b0acdf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1cdc9323c43">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17c10f163402" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8f76848d9371"><strong>User asks a question</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6690860332c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b733cc0ecc7d">Sent to the backend, scoped to the chat <code>=
thread_id</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fc3a1d954321">
<td data-local-id=3D"1875b05b7e93" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b125891977f">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e7f539a0852" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c0f9c8bd032"><strong>LangGraph agent</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0bcb02bb0dd9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"242db4c8f44b">Selects <code>retrieve_all_context_tool</code>=
 or <code>search_specific_information_tool</code> based on how specific the=
 question is.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1302d7b7972b">
<td data-local-id=3D"3f1feba0ebd3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c504758eb69">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa487375772d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"11da08ec20fc"><strong>Retrieve context</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"62ff69809470" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"28c0c3e9f479">Relevant chunks fetched from Azure AI Search,<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"5f535ec7e094"><strong>filtered by </strong><code>thread_id</=
code></p>
<p local-id=3D"b020d165b877">.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d89b4b01b17a"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7056a8876a83">
<td data-local-id=3D"feda3369af9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a81b6c5fcf32">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"732778ef1d50" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5274e8509bf5"><strong>LLM generates answer</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"941db301b6de" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8c5511ab014b">GPT synthesises a response grounded in the ret=
rieved chunks.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2acc277c6efd">
<td data-local-id=3D"4d315e02e535" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da5fa14368e5">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51a17fffb7b4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c92d32ae7050"><strong>Respond</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"511edf82894f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8dbfa2538f6d">Final answer streamed back to the Next.js chat=
 UI.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper =
confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image im=
age-center" alt=3D"image-20260812-123423.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy=
" src=3D"01ee5bfdfcf5ebdc5c33c6e90660d828be83d2606501ad3d11ab7df161e82f21" =
data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/downloa=
d/attachments/1733361714/image-20260812-123423.png?version=3D1&amp;modifica=
tionDate=3D1786538066325&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"=
1262" data-width=3D"6554" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-r=
esource-id=3D"1733525611" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-re=
source-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2026=
0812-123423.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.=
net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5=
" data-media-id=3D"49ff1739-1086-4bc5-9763-2bfbb066e1db" data-media-type=3D=
"file" height=3D"90"></span>
<p local-id=3D"15aeb2a5add9"></p>
<p local-id=3D"aea05125ad42"></p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"4fe9ee13d75c">
<p local-id=3D"fffcc9ab3811"><strong>Note:</strong> ingestion happens <stro=
ng>once per file</strong>, query happens <strong>per question</strong>. Sep=
arating the two is what keeps response latency low - the expensive parsing =
and embedding work is never repeated at question time.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"9e49a8979d4c">
<h2 local-id=3D"1e742e010bae" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-7.DocumentFlow-Excel/CS=
V(DuckDBAnalytics)">7. Document Flow - Excel / CSV (DuckDB Analytics)</h2><=
span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflue=
nce-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-cen=
ter" alt=3D"05-spreadsheet-duckdb-flow.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" =
src=3D"d391bdd72ec1fb13c7e4f1130b1cd743e4fed1e920abd421be106cdaed188a57" da=
ta-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/=
attachments/1733361714/05-spreadsheet-duckdb-flow.png?version=3D1&amp;modif=
icationDate=3D1786536323833&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=
=3D"540" data-width=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked=
-resource-id=3D"1733591144" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-=
resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"05-sprea=
dsheet-duckdb-flow.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atl=
assian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linke=
d-resource-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-versi=
on=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"aada04c7-eef5-4d81-8df4-c51b6cda2584" data-media-=
type=3D"file" height=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"7b8568b8dec3"><em>Figure 5 - Spreadsheets are queried direct=
ly on blob storage using DuckDB's in-memory OLAP engine, with no full inges=
tion into the vector index.</em></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d4=
88b4a24f76" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"87d85681514f">
<th data-local-id=3D"9de24584af60" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"606890dd1b5f">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"40e0358419f4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"125982734589">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a327506be162" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7ece44559084">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"41b371527138">
<td data-local-id=3D"db423e976d4b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6063efbddffb">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f63823342f3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d37e83ca2a39"><strong>User uploads Excel/CSV</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"ba0a239d2783" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ac864abd5013">Stored in ADLS Gen2 for the session.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"92b5b208c375">
<td data-local-id=3D"88b230af96df" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62e60b4e4eae">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4fc855852fa2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"476df1713ef2"><strong>DuckDB connects to blob</strong></p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8369b4cc7f95" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46b884f67fa6">The in-memory OLAP engine reads the file <stro=
ng>in place</strong> in ADLS - no copy, no ETL.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"407f600a0833">
<td data-local-id=3D"d8e7d9e8d553" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ab2120c0133">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ab3b57038817" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6bca5f3a3fcb"><strong>Question + metadata to LLM</strong></p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b2939144d5fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f69201115d4">Column names and schema metadata are described=
 to the LLM alongside the user's question.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa42e5509532">
<td data-local-id=3D"9a6b04faef9e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9aad344665a">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8771f952f5de" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1eec21f53a4d"><strong>LLM generates SQL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72af46896e74" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6fdf32029f64">The model writes a SQL query targeting the spr=
eadsheet's schema.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9deee7c306c2">
<td data-local-id=3D"f1b279dbd025" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec3584d8ef7b">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f0aa9f35d516" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b555dae5479"><strong>Execute &amp; respond</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"26be924bac80" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"579b286d12c8">DuckDB runs the query against the blob-stored =
file; the result is handed back to the agent, which composes the reply.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"55796bf68bc0" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-WhyDuckDBratherthanthev=
ectorindex?">Why DuckDB rather than the vector index?</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a1=
ab59de105c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7b7d7bcbc083">
<th data-local-id=3D"e2c77803eb5b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"affe1464439e">Reason</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"dacd99027434" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4a5551fe00cf">Explanation</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e68bfb9d3b0a">
<td data-local-id=3D"9cd1579736fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c41dd85505e4"><strong>No server, no ETL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"63581ba11a04" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d8f69af1820b">DuckDB is an embedded analytical database - no=
thing to provision or maintain.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"990cf65e7061">
<td data-local-id=3D"27cb706e0f0a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4a1b63cb8c56"><strong>Queries files in place</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"e855f2294a0f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a4f237ff7af">Connects directly to CSV/XLSX in ADLS Gen2 and=
 queries them with standard SQL.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"68d01a392027">
<td data-local-id=3D"a146c0aefe7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"00992ba7c0d9"><strong>Schema-driven, not similarity-driven</=
strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"230da246930d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35385ede43b7">The LLM is given the actual columns, so it wri=
tes precise SQL instead of guessing at semantically similar text.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"18e089cdf4ba">
<td data-local-id=3D"39c793588bad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10d1a9110e50"><strong>Millisecond results, nothing persisted=
</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"67030cf24e3b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1d7dafd3ce80">Execution is in-memory; no copy of the data is=
 written elsewhere.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6cb191d29da7">
<td data-local-id=3D"ac18487598ec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c10ed2292b26"><strong>Ephemeral and session-isolated</strong=
></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bd2ab8d0c709" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c12342dfcbff">Spreadsheet analysis lives and dies with the s=
ession, deliberately distinct from the long-lived RAG index used for docume=
nts.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<blockquote local-id=3D"bee12efdcf3a">
<p local-id=3D"09f53dfb6ca9"><strong>The general principle:</strong> <em>ta=
bular data should be queried, not retrieved.</em> Chunking a spreadsheet in=
to a vector index destroys exactly the structure - rows, columns, aggregate=
s - that makes the questions answerable. Sending it to a SQL engine preserv=
es it.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"87c7a29b8eed">
<h2 local-id=3D"1cdfa817515b" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-8.DocumentFlow-Images">=
8. Document Flow - Images</h2><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapp=
er image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"conf=
luence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"06-image-flow.png" width=3D"468"=
 loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"b95d33aed7a6eba382500e296c779d57c4b77a22474dc9d305=
3d9296978a2758" data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.=
net/wiki/download/attachments/1733361714/06-image-flow.png?version=3D1&amp;=
modificationDate=3D1786536346077&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-he=
ight=3D"540" data-width=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-li=
nked-resource-id=3D"1733099584" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-lin=
ked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"06-i=
mage-flow.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" =
data-media-id=3D"c3d74672-63da-4a10-a37e-76bd82fb6390" data-media-type=3D"f=
ile" height=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"fbfd6dfe2690"><em>Figure 6 - Images are described by Gemini =
2.5 Pro, embedded, and indexed for retrieval just like text documents.</em>=
</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"32=
f55764d5ce" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4372944c38bf">
<th data-local-id=3D"5149d90b7cf5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7991c7afe088">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"54ffdbb7540c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3d3e4d90d733">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"361fc566b2eb" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7f0af4c5a1e4">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2c6a8a121cfd">
<td data-local-id=3D"0bc84247d827" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b055436fd7d">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b2d1c88b468f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bed0b9e8af97"><strong>User uploads image</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6820d7abff4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"851b0b28f287">Stored in ADLS Gen2 for the session.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a5c9779ebb8a">
<td data-local-id=3D"e3b337370833" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f4169037f651">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7f83e5a40268" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c70f7b82d9cc"><strong>Gemini 2.5 Pro extracts content</stron=
g></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c4970c9ea776" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e6963acedd10">The model analyses the image and produces a ri=
ch text description of what it contains.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b78a69dc187d">
<td data-local-id=3D"3a6af4d5e714" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"346e9b854e9c">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aea1f7992ced" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cfbac9c5998e"><strong>Embed extracted text</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"945ed4aa98a8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75129e0f91da"><code>text-embedding-3-large</code> embeds the=
 description - the same model used for documents.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ec655d13850f">
<td data-local-id=3D"dccfae81ed53" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"93ab4288cfcf">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"efb953746cf2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c226dfe10f5"><strong>Index in Azure AI Search</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5f48fb3e3256" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"162515900bd6">Embedding plus text stored in the vector index=
, tagged with <code>thread_id</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8fbdb907ccc2">
<td data-local-id=3D"987666ee69e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"041fc5aedaa9">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa5380cacd42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d1a328378123"><strong>Query &amp; respond</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8431cf85756b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"069067fe569d">On a related question, <code>analyze_image_too=
l</code> retrieves the context and the agent answers.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"004bd0f24a41"><strong>Design points worth calling out:</stro=
ng></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f1e5936f3ea0">
<li local-id=3D"9ed83c18199a">
<p local-id=3D"57a55fc7d783">Gemini 2.5 Pro is chosen for its multimodal st=
rength - it converts charts, scanned pages, photos and diagrams into descri=
ptive text that behaves like any other document content.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"db0b7b8f12a9">
<p local-id=3D"0bab65869578">Because the same embedding model is used, imag=
e descriptions live in the <strong>same index</strong> as document chunks. =
A user's question can therefore draw on a PDF and a screenshot in one answe=
r, with no special handling.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9f8352a254c5">
<p local-id=3D"76b664b9bc27">Each image's chunks carry the session <code>th=
read_id</code>, so image context is only ever retrieved for the conversatio=
n that produced it.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fb462d37dd0">
<p local-id=3D"a3bb96a83721">At query time the retrieval is a vector search=
 restricted to <code>thread_id</code>; the matched description is fed to th=
e agent for final response generation.</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image-20260812-123519.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy"=
 src=3D"1fa004ea0477c8e337c2dc897a252e0accce0089c6e1bc50181cfe76e7606452" d=
ata-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download=
/attachments/1733361714/image-20260812-123519.png?version=3D1&amp;modificat=
ionDate=3D1786538122112&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"4=
12" data-width=3D"6155" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-res=
ource-id=3D"1733361787" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-reso=
urce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-202608=
12-123519.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" =
data-media-id=3D"e8b3a0db-e25d-49ed-93ea-d36fa14e248a" data-media-type=3D"f=
ile" height=3D"31"></span>
<p local-id=3D"3c98cdefca13"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"758f89bb4623">
<h2 local-id=3D"fcb8e33672e8" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-9.StructuredDataFlow-Az=
ureSQLDatabase">9. Structured Data Flow - Azure SQL Database</h2><span clas=
s=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embed=
ded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=
=3D"07-structured-sql-flow.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"a7070=
5e60b33671d7f76ba9fbea4082077375f90707f1a3755fd0523c36f2976" data-image-src=
=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
1733361714/07-structured-sql-flow.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D17=
86536373523&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"540" data-wid=
th=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1=
733361741" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"=
attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"07-structured-sql-flow.pn=
g" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki" data=
-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-=
id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-i=
d=3D"e8c6aa17-2d4d-4422-b669-60d79b4cc56e" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"88971ef924e6"><em>Figure 7 - Natural-language questions are =
converted to SQL and executed against Azure SQL.</em></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"da=
33b4cf5c8d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"45733c59a3ee">
<th data-local-id=3D"519949d03220" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ee299d298e77">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"840b883afd0a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9c74fac1db22">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"27f11af2766f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"68589f748a22">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a9b7a93684b5">
<td data-local-id=3D"a7c630f896cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f8437593dc80">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a34545a30d4d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c92538cf41b"><strong>User asks a data question</strong></p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cb639634a6b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c678091be0f">e.g. <em>"What were Q3 sales for Product X?"</=
em></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"42d5e7b4ed31">
<td data-local-id=3D"a5bf02a455d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4eaf191e0a45">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2aed61e76d24" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"898584eabaf4"><strong>Agent selects tool</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0fba0d05d91b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6daa2f1c90af">LangGraph invokes <code>retrieve_data_from_sql=
</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"daf0867749df">
<td data-local-id=3D"d2f98b888153" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3f8ab8880cd">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b20fefd6fce1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"741b160c5fe1"><strong>LLM generates SQL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d8a123d5616b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6fceeab9670b">Question plus table/column metadata are sent t=
o the LLM, which writes the query.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e0a60a67aa4f">
<td data-local-id=3D"6f53d2e3eae4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82a338acc5df">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d4f95906860" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"39ef5bc0707d"><strong>Execute on Azure SQL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"034bfaa377f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8f924e92ebe2">The generated SQL runs against the Azure SQL c=
lient.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"92a01ee7c463">
<td data-local-id=3D"79cabfcb2f95" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fad71a58b57a">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be2b9bd6be7d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c865a6ef595f"><strong>Respond</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a35901978ed7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7eecdcf18902">Results return to the agent, which formats the=
 final natural-language answer.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"14c471fdeb58" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-DatadomainsavailableinA=
zureSQL">Data domains available in Azure SQL</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8f=
523c169ac5" class=3D"confluenceTable">
