<hr local-id=3D"6926d52a8b89">
<h2 local-id=3D"606ea0b01e20" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.DeepDive-WhyStructur=
edDataQ&amp;AIsNotStraightforward">10. Deep Dive - Why Structured Data Q&am=
p;A Is Not Straightforward</h2>
<p local-id=3D"621282a9572b">This is the most important engineering section=
 of the page. Document RAG tolerates approximation; <strong>structured data=
 questions do not</strong>. A user asking <em>"show me all products that=E2=
=80=A6"</em> expects a complete, exact list - the same list an analyst woul=
d produce by hand.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b4fc4ac65dbd">Two distinct challenges arise, and each has it=
s own solution.</p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"fe7c056af326">
<p local-id=3D"d2e1229ed9ff"><strong>Note on examples:</strong> the product=
 values used below are anonymised illustrations of the real catalogue. The =
structure of the problem is unchanged.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 local-id=3D"32fe4a6d9c68" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.1Challenge1-Entityva=
luesinthequestionaren'tthevaluesinthedatabase">10.1 Challenge 1 - Entity va=
lues in the question aren't the values in the database</h3>
<p local-id=3D"46b0d35489eb"><strong>Sample product data</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"4d=
8628825151" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d58563220859">
<th data-local-id=3D"76f44f7cf976" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a86387dbf0f9">ProductID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"dc5594d09827" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c7e2b7f5b412">BrandName</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"aa5741693c71" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2272c9c6bd52">Ingredients</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"063c903084af" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7e1846f73c66">Benefits</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b202335e2ca5">
<td data-local-id=3D"eef2eb1c8b42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cd16a82e7d6c">HBL001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1dde39249bb0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"232566ad9371">BrandA Intensive Care</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a1102a4243e4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9337fcfc7b00">Aloe Vera, Glycerin</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bbb35da158be" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f1a3d8239cf">Moisturization, Soothing</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5003c5abd096">
<td data-local-id=3D"5176094c56c2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"11dfb25bca08">SC001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"844d95af3f4d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b671011062f">BrandB Deep Moisture</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"61d240506025" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa2e8e5a982d">Glycerin, Sunflower Oil</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cb8ca7beb7d4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a65e197e415b">Cleansing, Soft Skin</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4c42c9dea372">
<td data-local-id=3D"6c4322e2c5cf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbe6e279a284">HC001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5570db35d3b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b29c3c5e81e1">BrandB Intense Repair</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"152c1c471f9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1e7f9256a70e">Keratin, Glycerin</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0765588ab47f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2fc7547b3bf3">Damage Repair, Smoothness</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"f7b8ab941039">Users type <em>"BrandA"</em>, <em>"aloe"</em>,=
 <em>"shampoo"</em>. The database stores precise values - <em>"BrandA Inten=
sive Care"</em>, <em>"Aloe Vera"</em>, <em>"Haircare / Shampoo"</em>. Exact=
-match filters <strong>fail silently</strong>: they return zero rows and th=
e user is told, confidently, that nothing matched.</p>
<p local-id=3D"82f48d55c8cf"><strong>Worked question:</strong> <em>"Show me=
 all BrandA products for dry skin"</em></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"40=
964a2bd0f0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"57fde682460e">
<th data-local-id=3D"0ee71db80d83" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6fc05a0429db">Naive assumption</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"732f48bdb169" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4354f824785d">Reality</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bd487fa41430">
<td data-local-id=3D"a04c2a1bcb78" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"adea338dbcfe"><code>WHERE BrandName =3D 'BrandA'</code></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"76bddbc709bf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79311438c7e1"><code>BrandName</code> stores <em>"BrandA Inte=
nsive Care"</em> - no rows returned</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"052d814e93ee">
<td data-local-id=3D"d709821cd5a0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"482a813ace03">"dry skin" is a filterable column</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a58e48a2b388" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"20c7c1ef95c6">It isn't. It maps to <code>Benefits</code> val=
ues such as <em>"Moisturization"</em> and <em>"Soothing"</em></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d4ca7a0ddf0a">
<td data-local-id=3D"6da3dfdbe57f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"56aaa0886b51">One clean query answers it</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d563040c38a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f7556a3d4924">The question must first be <strong>translated =
into the vocabulary of the data</strong></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"98a91af8f812" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.2Solution1-EntityRes=
olutionFlow">10.2 Solution 1 - Entity Resolution Flow</h3><span class=3D"co=
nfluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-man=
ual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"08-e=
ntity-resolution-flow.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"8b444c0969=
4a9c5869451cef1b958e58301257cd180396766ee0212d5107dd33" data-image-src=3D"h=
ttps://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/17333=
61714/08-entity-resolution-flow.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1786=
536390497&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"540" data-width=
=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"173=
3361748" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"at=
tachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"08-entity-resolution-flow.p=
ng" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki" dat=
a-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container=
-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-=
id=3D"79449138-d208-47d7-9d6a-2b7ff8aed072" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"0192d7898740"><em>Figure 8 - Resolving fuzzy user terms to e=
xact database values before any SQL is written.</em></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6b=
312b834c3c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4eafe5ac0d47">
<th data-local-id=3D"6ebbfcff9375" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"70cc6192bf29">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0dc52181c681" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fa0e5f3d8f56">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"40bee5359536" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"699f2a27313d">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f4284050ada5">
<td data-local-id=3D"e42675500cee" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94646d8a70ca">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9b1488a957a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1e85c492a76"><strong>User question</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"26d68f679704" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c931e026c25">Free-text question received by the backend.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3b6384056380">
<td data-local-id=3D"54d3797d513d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e120a60bf0fa">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5d5749342658" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e946b64b7a2"><strong>LLM extracts entities</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"e2c1d972d609" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d34e4c0af39">The model pulls candidate Category / Subcatego=
ry / Format / Brand / Ingredient / Benefit terms out of the question.</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"91a968f39fa0">
<td data-local-id=3D"93d1f7ea91b9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ff076ec890e">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95b9ac66c668" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6553799dc863"><strong>Search indexed entities</strong></p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b61f26b1dacd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"440c5bfd0d5a">Each extracted term is matched against indexed=
 entity values in Azure AI Search; top-N similar values are returned per en=
tity.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ec8a3091778d">
<td data-local-id=3D"3cc7edb024a3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c560878b35e8">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4f1afd3bf2ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35475bd449b4"><strong>LLM filters candidates</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"4583809b0b75" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"80f99118a635">The question plus the candidate values go back=
 to the LLM, which keeps only the values that genuinely apply.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c9a7fb047eda">
<td data-local-id=3D"7ea490d85c9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"38589ea97f77">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f62b45187415" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a55c0f07cf52"><strong>Generate SQL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"48d1211c9e1b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c82f0c18b0af">Question plus resolved exact values are passed=
 to the query-generator LLM.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bbdb0f244917">
<td data-local-id=3D"9a20ce5a0334" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7684a4528e84">6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"24708bbab05f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e2c184a83628"><strong>Execute &amp; respond</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"dc3d70d5f1ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12b48167a9d5">Query runs on Azure SQL; results are formatted=
 into the final answer.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"ae002ecbaea3"><strong>Entity types resolved this way:</stron=
g> Category =C2=B7 Subcategory =C2=B7 Format =C2=B7 Brand =C2=B7 Ingredient=
 =C2=B7 Benefit</p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"c28394b7ddd8">
<p local-id=3D"38fa84946a09"><strong>Why the double LLM pass matters.</stro=
ng> Azure AI Search on its own returns values that are merely <em>similar</=
em> to the user's words - a search for a brand returns several near matches=
. The second LLM pass cross-checks those candidates against the actual ques=
tion and keeps only the ones that are truly correct, producing the exact va=
lue the SQL query needs. Skipping this pass produces queries that are synta=
ctically valid and semantically wrong.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 local-id=3D"d2d159f6d86f" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.3Workedexample,endto=
end">10.3 Worked example, end to end</h3>
<p local-id=3D"da3728250d36"><strong>Question:</strong> <em>"Show me all Br=
andA products for dry skin"</em></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file=
-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"LangGraph Orchestrator-2=
026-08-12-123653.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"45654cb1163f365=
62e0d12faf7aefdb26db3b41b88158ca4d008656d18366437" data-image-src=3D"https:=
//lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1733361714=
/LangGraph%20Orchestrator-2026-08-12-123653.png?version=3D1&amp;modificatio=
nDate=3D1786538241776&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"436=
5" data-width=3D"7380" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-reso=
urce-id=3D"1733034121" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resou=
rce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"LangGraph Orc=
hestrator-2026-08-12-123653.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanag=
ement.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-contai=
ner-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"aceb03e7-92b6-40e5-9152-3d4eb48a2786" da=
ta-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"276"></span>
<p local-id=3D"fb51b3f7229b"></p>
<p local-id=3D"268d089427a5"><strong>Resulting query shape:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE BrandName =3D 'BrandA Intensive Care'
  AND ( Benefits LIKE '%Moisturization%'
     OR Benefits LIKE '%Soothing%' );</pre>
</div>
</div>
