<hr local-id=3D"e0f22535c383">
<h3 local-id=3D"8d6a265e35d5" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.4Challenge2-Thefree-=
textDescriptionfield">10.4 Challenge 2 - The free-text <code>Description</c=
ode> field</h3><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center=
-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded=
-image image-center" alt=3D"09-description-field-problem.png" width=3D"468"=
 loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"154d705fa32be1bd21fa72a96dcd6069958f4fafc9ccb41280=
4edc6282768273" data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.=
net/wiki/download/attachments/1733361714/09-description-field-problem.png?v=
ersion=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1786536410377&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;ap=
i=3Dv2" data-height=3D"540" data-width=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-coun=
t=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1733099592" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defaul=
t-alias=3D"09-description-field-problem.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-kn=
owledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"=
image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-res=
ource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"3fee6940-7d63-4946-a2a8-74b6=
ca67b659" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"4a8546e591c8"><em>Figure 9 - Why pure similarity search is n=
ot reliable enough for quantitative product questions.</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"255289d39a0f">Some questions can only be answered from the f=
ree-text <code>Description</code> column - for example, <em>"Show me all th=
e hair fall resistant products."</em> There is no <code>HairFallResistant</=
code> column; the concept exists only in prose.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d134c3b5f069"><strong>The naive approach:</strong> run a sim=
ilarity search over <code>Description</code> in Azure AI Search and take th=
e top-K results, or everything above a score threshold.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5d8917fa89de"><strong>The observed outcome:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"86=
3bc33bcaf0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6cf1ebfc336b">
<th data-local-id=3D"fc62bd54cafa" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"84f4bd1dc501">Result</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"299c5569159a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c2ccda439ab0">Count</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"81a1e79e50eb">
<td data-local-id=3D"52ebdf4e9106" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ebb3a6a3156">Products returned</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cc94b617da8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f1d2ca3b9d2">~100</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0bcf46d11ab8">
<td data-local-id=3D"62166a8eb626" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67a5759b2eea">Truly relevant</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"28d169f7ec22" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a83bfc366f02">~80</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e8f6b485e6ee">
<td data-local-id=3D"2f1d940fead2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"478e6f42f69c">Noise - products that merely share wording</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"22bf6dc765d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b135e1324360">~20</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"cacab5488545"><strong>Why similarity search alone falls shor=
t here:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"2818fc89f043">
<li local-id=3D"c12193d1122f">
<p local-id=3D"f9b3737fb145">Azure AI Search ranks by semantic and keyword =
similarity, <strong>not exact business meaning</strong> - it cannot reliabl=
y distinguish <em>"hair fall resistant"</em> from loosely related haircare =
copy.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"03df1fa6e25b">
<p local-id=3D"dbcd2a47ce19">Any fixed top-K or score threshold is a guess.=
 Set it low and real matches are missed; set it high and noise creeps in. <=
strong>There is no setting that is reliably 100% precise.</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6fddb2e64ed">
<p local-id=3D"5eaf04ad915f">Users treat description-based questions as a <=
strong>factual lookup</strong> - <em>"how many"</em>, <em>"show me all"</em=
>. An approximate answer to a counting question silently erodes trust in th=
e whole platform.</p></li>
</ul>
<blockquote local-id=3D"b3dbcd22c11f">
<p local-id=3D"93f9862afdac"><strong>Conclusion:</strong> Azure AI Search i=
s valuable as a <em>starting signal</em>, but it cannot be the <em>final fi=
lter</em> when the answer must be numerically accurate.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 local-id=3D"bdabbc1eb5ac" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.5Solution2-AISearcha=
sacomplementarysignal,SQLasthesourceoftruth">10.5 Solution 2 - AI Search as=
 a complementary signal, SQL as the source of truth</h3><span class=3D"conf=
luence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manua=
l-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"10-des=
cription-field-solution.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"26b4eb67=
7c7baff85df0fb8dd5e25c5e4bbef3d0c798281ce34a949a07ae019e" data-image-src=3D=
"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/173=
3361714/10-description-field-solution.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1786536435768&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"540" dat=
a-width=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"1733034070" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-typ=
e=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"10-description-field=
-solution.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" =
data-media-id=3D"657def24-207b-419c-b90c-eb264570bcba" data-media-type=3D"f=
ile" height=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"5799362d60a1"><em>Figure 10 - AI Search surfaces the candida=
te phrasing; SQL delivers the exact result.</em></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"fd=
138c10d739" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"03d1d3ac6cba">
<th data-local-id=3D"d1b0e4e7437d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ccb081801569">Step</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"70b61ddbddbb" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f404ba87ecb4">Stage</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8bdfa3400859" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c8fdc385cc36">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9f2584dfc90a">
<td data-local-id=3D"4d7714a41618" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14d6bc683728">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eb62c527c3e4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a55a48a5cf7"><strong>Similarity search</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"740619016ecb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c20d992f937a">Run the question against Azure AI Search; take=
 the top 10=E2=80=9320 matching description chunks.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"318f1c4afa40">
<td data-local-id=3D"9df76b786d28" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cff9e496ebbb">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"84190b27a308" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51af228e6198"><strong>Pass matches to LLM</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bb789da929a0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14cb6a2ca66d">The matched sentences plus the original questi=
on are sent to the LLM.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"47778af1298d">
<td data-local-id=3D"d2213cc2b378" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb3488f3f2e4">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"63136da9b017" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba5be72191bb"><strong>Extract exact keywords</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"ac86065e5c27" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"402142deeb32">The LLM returns the precise phrasing actually =
used in the data - e.g. <em>"hair fall resistant"</em>, <em>"anti hairfall"=
</em>, <em>"hairfall rescue"</em>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f6f874459da">
<td data-local-id=3D"7181a84d888b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"859aff5a1e28">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"900cf776a93e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e7fcbeb5c0bf"><strong>Generate SQL with </strong><code>LIKE<=
/code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7368c91d8ca2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"adfc10a24612">The query-generator LLM builds a query using t=
hose keywords as <code>LIKE</code> conditions on <code>Description</code>.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"723b9cc27116">
<td data-local-id=3D"c1a3b02d6dab" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"61c2621067b7">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e0f5f7228b1b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbadbe71b9e0"><strong>Execute on Azure SQL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"960802946f78" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f6bf3fcd0d01">The query runs against the <strong>full table =
- not a sample</strong> - so every matching row is captured.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4972390a9c24">
<td data-local-id=3D"15ca46800772" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e41c187d6b3b">6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b863fe9eb337" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a93da191bcb"><strong>Exact, accurate result</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"ed973a788f40" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8ab279e935c">The precise count and list of matching product=
s, free of similarity noise.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"d568dd01669c"><strong>Example generated query:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE Description LIKE '%hair fall resistant%'
   OR Description LIKE '%anti hairfall%'
   OR Description LIKE '%hairfall rescue%';</pre>
</div>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper =
confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image im=
age-center" alt=3D"image-20260812-124151.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy=
" src=3D"8b864d31369d7c0c46b9c72439e1b81f7179f18b2403fc43a13ae70ff6ffc438" =
data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/downloa=
d/attachments/1733361714/image-20260812-124151.png?version=3D1&amp;modifica=
tionDate=3D1786538515216&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"=
386" data-width=3D"6553" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-re=
source-id=3D"1733722190" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-res=
ource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20260=
812-124151.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.n=
et/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resour=
ce-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5"=
 data-media-id=3D"af91697a-96f5-4e88-8fd7-aa96c59a159b" data-media-type=3D"=
file" height=3D"27"></span>
<blockquote local-id=3D"cf6cfd2079e5">
<p local-id=3D"463eaa8af2ba">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F <strong>Known trade-off - l=
atency.</strong> Multiple <code>LIKE</code> clauses, one per keyword, incre=
ase query cost on large tables and add to overall tool response time. This =
is a <strong>current, actively monitored issue</strong> and a candidate for=
 optimisation (see =C2=A713).</p>
</blockquote>
<p local-id=3D"a3363faaf142"><strong>Net effect:</strong> Azure AI Search n=
arrows the universe of relevant phrasing; SQL <code>LIKE</code> then guaran=
tees completeness and accuracy across the full dataset - trading some laten=
cy for trustworthy, quantitative answers.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"30c73049caca" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-10.6Summaryoftheretriev=
alphilosophy">10.6 Summary of the retrieval philosophy</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b9=
ec9ef63e91" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2110b5da1fd3">
<th data-local-id=3D"0dba168fd47c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"780ee8a2e299">Question type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f79c1bbaa49f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"912b78ac6f2a">Approximate retrieval acceptable?</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5c872b801ed9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bd23c9de4a0a">Final answer produced by</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa0a46798352">
<td data-local-id=3D"b4a3b0c80bd6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9cf9903ba84d">"Summarise this document"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95382975a1c9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c3b4251475d9">Yes - synthesis is inherently fuzzy</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"26cce8f1fd89" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ab756d17caa">Vector retrieval =E2=86=92 LLM</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9dda14428abb">
<td data-local-id=3D"7c4c3e4a9792" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c1a093a9bc4">"What does this image show?"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dacf5ce0cf8e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4db8fc026952">Yes</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1560c0874e89" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e255ab90e6e">Gemini description =E2=86=92 vector retrieval =
=E2=86=92 LLM</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d5715f680e58">
<td data-local-id=3D"5edca2376829" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ba78f0ea83f">"How many products match X?"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1b1502e51563" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e7b1c928033c"><strong>No</strong> - must be exact and comple=
te</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"36920dc9a62a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"376d6867af61">AI Search for vocabulary =E2=86=92 <strong>SQL=
 over the full table</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"99f4f1249f96">
<td data-local-id=3D"a442b6f10502" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c998a80e9061">"What were Q3 sales?"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"edba0c182fe7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04b7251adf91"><strong>No</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1775b06c7bdd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"687563d109f7">Entity resolution =E2=86=92 <strong>SQL</stron=
g></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fae22b8c279f">
<td data-local-id=3D"3098848a79a2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0672745a279">"Which region in my spreadsheet had lowest mar=
gin?"</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"db9a66b83af3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"351305701ff7"><strong>No</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"195b18d5066b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26676140e526"><strong>DuckDB SQL over the file</strong></p><=
/td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"707cff97e584">
<h2 local-id=3D"26b61defdd8e" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-11.SessionManagement&am=
p;DataIsolation">11. Session Management &amp; Data Isolation</h2><span clas=
s=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embed=
ded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=
=3D"11-session-isolation.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"04005c3=
8257f5db83f5fda37fac94844b997f309a5f27d50b390af175e37a56b" data-image-src=
=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
1733361714/11-session-isolation.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1786=
536461100&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"540" data-width=
=3D"960" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"173=
3132356" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"at=
tachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"11-session-isolation.png" d=
ata-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki" data-lin=
ked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=
=3D"bd3e1095-3f04-4b62-96e7-d2328c12da41" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"262"></span>
<p local-id=3D"a0feb23fdfb2"><em>Figure 11 - Every chat session is bound to=
 a unique </em><code>thread_id</code><em>, which scopes and isolates all da=
ta created during that session.</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"d7562bd31aec">Every chat session is issued a unique <code>th=
read_id</code>. That identifier is propagated to every artefact the session=
 creates:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6c=
b7a6dcfec7" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dda60d6663cf">
<th data-local-id=3D"d3e427c3bf56" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"34b32d8f3d07">Bound to <code>thread_id</code></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"7ac4e429e5fe" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b3894ad34757">What it holds</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"176e54e54200">
<td data-local-id=3D"5258786dd8e9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b17d42f7c62a"><strong>Chat session (UI)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"442932e4e3d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4a39e540251">Frontend conversation thread - history and sta=
te in Next.js</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"172ef4e372db">
<td data-local-id=3D"ca79395424bc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cc559ba5f5d7"><strong>ADLS folder</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"65ea34d4ca6d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9f09dea7f6f">Uploaded files for this session: PDF, PPT, DOC=
X, XLSX, CSV, images</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"32c3037a8789">
<td data-local-id=3D"4c2cc716c52e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"444f014b1c4a"><strong>AI Search chunks</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"31686273be63" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43188687f088">Vector chunks stored with the <code>thread_id<=
/code>; retrieval <strong>filters</strong> on it</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"49a1fea9b289">
<td data-local-id=3D"e58f03acd563" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a3660204b9d"><strong>DuckDB session data</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"75d505a39952" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"182f3ac71516">Spreadsheet files for this session, queried in=
-memory</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper =
confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image im=
age-center" alt=3D"image-20260812-124330.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy=
" src=3D"ab77a40647d2284b5a2d372291148f16705d60741c9e82030fa8c2ca55a7026a" =
data-image-src=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.net/wiki/downloa=
d/attachments/1733361714/image-20260812-124330.png?version=3D1&amp;modifica=
tionDate=3D1786538613024&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"=
1685" data-width=3D"3522" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-r=
esource-id=3D"1733132407" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-re=
source-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2026=
0812-124330.png" data-base-url=3D"https://lv-knowledgemanagement.atlassian.=
net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-id=3D"1733361714" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5=
" data-media-id=3D"25b58595-f03a-41a6-8b29-6dc87ceaff21" data-media-type=3D=
"file" height=3D"223"></span>
<p local-id=3D"67be35632423"></p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"d5a98b87337d">
<p local-id=3D"e72980bdf4ff">=E2=9C=85 <strong>Result:</strong> queries, re=
trievals and tool calls within a session never leak data from, or into, ano=
ther user's session. Isolation is enforced at the <strong>retrieval filter<=
/strong>, not merely by UI separation - a mis-scoped request returns nothin=
g rather than someone else's content.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"d9cef66b3c58">
<h2 local-id=3D"bed5ea35c09a" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-12.DesignDecisions&amp;=
Trade-offs">12. Design Decisions &amp; Trade-offs</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a6=
816f7c5dea" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"500a6fffaf8d">
<th data-local-id=3D"a15ef21084c4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"222c141b40ce">Decision</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d297e3550067" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8ec1d21ec838">Rationale</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"17513708312f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"73d7eed1d281">Trade-off accepted</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"21084d8d4d51">
<td data-local-id=3D"1734d10defc9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3681e133286d">Single LangGraph agent with 8 bound tools</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"70177cfa62be" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32d477373553">One chat box for the user; complexity stays se=
rver-side; follow-ups inherit context</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"806923e03b6b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"119565a4726b">Routing quality becomes a first-class concern =
- a mis-route is a wrong answer</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f1e7fa827477">
<td data-local-id=3D"d1c05f5837a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4851a45e7ed7">Vector index for documents and images; SQL for=
 tabular data</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c64027ff1a6e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b79a716b7dd2">Preserves the structure that tabular questions=
 depend on</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7edd8bbd4996" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"527602eb0f46">Two retrieval paradigms to maintain</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"74186de9d57b">
<td data-local-id=3D"a2c6bdd5597a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e95174bacd14">DuckDB queries files in place in ADLS</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e76b878f7a6c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08620035c680">No ETL, no server, millisecond results, nothin=
g persisted</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d2bd85e8c741" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c4ae9888c5df">Session-scoped only; not suitable for long-liv=
ed analytics</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d78f515f7bc8">
<td data-local-id=3D"bd0694d05e1d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55cca2cdfe14">Gemini for images, GPT for reasoning</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e1803208b84" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c05173705aa">Best model per job, behind one abstraction</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a4b0de8f702f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3026b7f4ff29">Two provider dependencies</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5a0465e872f5">
<td data-local-id=3D"7d39ec3042e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"335fa8501983">Double LLM pass in entity resolution</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5cb430892641" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1395e39cc942">Turns "similar" candidates into <em>correct</e=
m> values</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e2e3ee5f77c6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e1b26c8844da">Extra model call per query - latency and cost<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d72e5c8fd8e">
<td data-local-id=3D"31d433681f03" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"842167a6e2cf">AI Search narrows, SQL <code>LIKE</code> decid=
es</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa82233c027f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"59ca41a6b80f">Guarantees exact, complete answers on quantita=
tive questions</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f432a203db77" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"18ba974797e4">Multiple <code>LIKE</code> clauses raise query=
 cost on large tables - <strong>actively monitored</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1fb5900f3ba7">
<td data-local-id=3D"28e2f8258d05" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9cd54dfccc2d"><code>thread_id</code> on every artefact</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"101c2f103b54" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3105d53aa0e5">Enforceable isolation at the storage/retrieval=
 layer</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3da4e7978c06" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"468049b62a6b">Cross-session knowledge reuse is deliberately =
impossible</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"d3584dedc7d4">
<h2 local-id=3D"28ad9c12cc65" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-13.KnownIssues&amp;Next=
Steps">13. Known Issues &amp; Next Steps</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d9=
dfda6ca6d9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"650b3d47dc32">
<th data-local-id=3D"4e104bf914f1" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ebb28d941339">Item</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ebb514db187d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"75badd5e598d">Status</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6aaa80c4d356" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8827c662f07f">Notes</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d79dfe280092">
<td data-local-id=3D"636aca6fbd79" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b58570fc329d">Latency from multi-keyword <code>LIKE</code> q=
ueries on large tables</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ed27301a0721" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"647e90d7f4b7">=F0=9F=9F=A0 Actively monitored</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c16184435405" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c35aae569de8">Candidates: full-text indexing on <code>Descri=
ption</code>, materialised keyword flags, caching resolved keyword sets</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eb8fae7b3d30">
<td data-local-id=3D"c83c54ad4e37" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b90537ae15d">Entity resolution adds an extra LLM round-trip=
 per query</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c5baf12f45c2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4df0a94a914e">=F0=9F=9F=A0 Monitored</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1649ae7450e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"71f1d188804b">Candidate: cache resolved entity values per se=
ssion</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9bf02962648d">
<td data-local-id=3D"44d54c0c6f91" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e7a83c451b22">Routing accuracy across 8 tools</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1f76b8d8e16b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd40dd92e570">=F0=9F=9F=A2 Stable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d8715b449af3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"251755c22d64">Worth adding routing telemetry to quantify mis=
-routes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"de0e29c0439f">
<td data-local-id=3D"d0c5233b1426" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9ba9b34e39d">Spreadsheet analysis is session-ephemeral</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e2f169fc4a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a3b8263a0483">=E2=84=B9=EF=B8=8F By design</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bd6b50cf4383" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2264dca83835">Revisit only if users ask for persistent workb=
ooks</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"33caba698396">
<h2 local-id=3D"f98d487f0439" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-14.Glossary">14. Glossa=
ry</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"71=
41a099a6ae" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"568bb25b93bb">
<th data-local-id=3D"532ec7bfe401" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"daba2f3ecbdc">Term</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"dbfc53673c61" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bde572540f81">Meaning</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1214b42a19ed">
<td data-local-id=3D"b5fe9a885062" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"742cb89f9fad"><strong>RAG</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cf77562d7633" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4e439d6667df">Retrieval-Augmented Generation - retrieve rele=
vant content first, then have the LLM answer using it</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"160721e21460">
<td data-local-id=3D"5e1af085c76b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"776c76fd42ba"><strong>NL2SQL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f14153bddfcf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8a2ff8acbd75">Converting a natural-language question into an=
 executable SQL query</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"421365db1a47">
<td data-local-id=3D"a9955e296c41" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9a2b18cc3a7"><strong>Embedding</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4d6b160656e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0dc0a811f79f">A numeric vector representing the meaning of a=
 piece of text, enabling similarity search</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d766af00e003">
<td data-local-id=3D"a2cc67edc30d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"371ce50ab808"><strong>Chunk</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"463c72da52e1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b493e0c2b11">A segment of a document that is embedded and i=
ndexed independently</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2cb22cb420ba">
<td data-local-id=3D"f94349178c6a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f04b0cff5ba"><code>thread_id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"54335508dd4b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"54d174257120">Unique identifier for a chat session; scopes f=
iles, vectors and session data</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4391cad12be6">
<td data-local-id=3D"a6161c283b45" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cba5f8e67ae0"><strong>SAS URL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fe794d7e2f9b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1becb0e612df">Shared Access Signature URL - a time-limited l=
ink letting the UI preview a blob-stored file</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"767e21b018ca">
<td data-local-id=3D"3e1ff06b9025" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a0783f8a4555"><strong>OLAP</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6f99e54b2fb4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ebb49a0f929a">Online Analytical Processing - column-oriented=
 querying optimised for aggregation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cab284f5ed8e">
<td data-local-id=3D"84797e322814" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec42ac4ff704"><strong>Entity resolution</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"731aedacdff7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e55566b4f691">Mapping a user's informal term to the exact va=
lue stored in the database</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"60c85a7b112c">
<td data-local-id=3D"59f070b82d50" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c6bdae4f86c2"><strong>Claims (CPG)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f3cfaa0a8aa7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74b3f4627e44">Product claims in consumer packaged goods, ext=
racted from documents and scored by a custom ML model</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"586db09a62a1">
<h2 local-id=3D"aef746830de0" id=3D"DelphiAIChatbot-15.ConferenceTalkingPoi=
nts">15. Conference Talking Points</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f4a5d3477915">Five things worth saying out loud when present=
ing this page:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"424527571d81">
<li local-id=3D"cadbde77f42a">
<p local-id=3D"d51a20352ccc"><strong>"The user never picks a mode."</strong=
> One chat box; the agent infers whether the question is about a document, =
a spreadsheet, an image or the warehouse.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b636496e2fc">
<p local-id=3D"d0acdf05f64e"><strong>"Tabular data is queried, not retrieve=
d."</strong> Chunking a spreadsheet into a vector index destroys the struct=
ure the question depends on. DuckDB and Azure SQL preserve it.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"63717fbbf656">
<p local-id=3D"9bc694a31304"><strong>"Similarity search cannot answer a cou=
nting question."</strong> ~100 results, ~80 relevant, ~20 noise - and no th=
reshold fixes it. That observation drove the whole hybrid design.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"98c1bfe392dc">
<p local-id=3D"f4f7871d5d97"><strong>"Search finds the vocabulary; SQL find=
s the rows."</strong> AI Search tells us <em>how the data phrases the conce=
pt</em>; SQL then scans the full table so nothing is missed.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a4e030f57c57">
<p local-id=3D"3f49bd90f8f8"><strong>"Isolation is a filter, not a conventi=
on."</strong> <code>thread_id</code> is on the files, the vectors and the r=
etrieval query - so a mis-scoped request returns nothing at all.</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"25809569f4e9">
    </div>
</body>
</html>
